      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} you're welcome-\n\napart from that one example i wrote in the post, there is also something else that happens, sometimes i can use particle shaders on quest, but some other times i can not. this could likely be checked with a debugger or de-hallucinator.\n\n1 issue can be solved easily.\n\nsometimes the VRCworld prefab breaks, and all it takes is replacing it with a new VRCworld prefab which could be done automatically every time it breaks, and when it gets replaced it could retain the data of the previous VRCworld prefab.\n\nsometimes it can take 1 single world upload to break the VRCworld prefab that is in the worlds sdk 2022.\n\nsometimes when i try to upload a world it takes 20mins compute and then it doesn't do the actual uploading part, but if i retry and i reload the SDK first then it correctly uploads it.\n\nsometimes i try to upload a pc avatar on pc and it tells me that i can only use VRChat/Mobile shaders, this could likely be re-checked by the sdk instead of having to close and re open unity, it would be so much better!",
